Package: dstx
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd, udev, dbus
Description: Driver for PlayStation DualSense, DS4 and Nintendo Switch Pro controllers
 DSTX provides advanced configuration (LED, rumble, macros) for game controllers.
 This package contains the core daemon, D-Bus bridge, and graphical interface.
